# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# Everything from 3D Systems stays out of this repository.
#
# The OpenHaptics Developer Edition licence (OpenHaptics/docs/
# OpenHapticsDeveloperEditionLicense.txt, section 2) forbids
# redistributing the SDK: "the Authorized User may not use, copy,
# modify, or distribute the Software". The same goes for their manuals.
# The two installers are over GitHub's 100 MB per-file limit anyway.
#
# Run  下载安装包.bat  (code/setup/fetch_vendor.py) to fetch all of it
# from 3D Systems' own download server.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
vendor/
OpenHaptics/

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# C++ build output
code/touchcpp/*.exe
code/touchcpp/*.obj
code/touchcpp/*.pdb
code/touchcpp/*.ilk
